y_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"hfcJ8a-mz2pO1NU3cmeWrQ","review_id":"IrCmnZ9PB0ZILoeLaY1yxQ","date":"2020-01-19T01:17:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9337949752807617,"text_excerpt":"What a wonderful comfort food vegan place! I got the spicy chicken sandwich, and as I'm not a vegan, it was surprising how much it truly tasted like chicken! At times the seiten was a bit too chewy, but at others, the sandwich was wonderfully textured. Was definitely comparable to the Popeyes chicken sandwich. The fries were nicely seasoned with tony's seasoning. My friend got the spicy chicken tenders, and she enjoyed them as well. They were seiten, paired with a nice agave mustard. The only qualm I would have is that the seiten was a bit greasy. Overall, enjoyed this place for a late lunch, and would come back to try their lemon coconut cupcake!"},{"business_id":"hfcJ8a-mz2pO1NU3cmeWrQ","review_id":"IaEsvW4cdXTe3lNXV2H6Xw","date":"2020-02-06T20:25:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9265506267547607,"text_excerpt":"Really cool plant-based restaurant with great customer service. I ordered a veggie burger with fries and \"mac and cheese\". The burger was cooked nicely, but there was too much mayo. I had to scrap mayo with the napkin which was super messy. The fries were nice, and although the mac and cheese did not taste like traditional mac and cheese, it was so good. I would go out my way to get this mac and cheese. For my hubby, I took him and \"chik'n sandwich\", and he loved it. He went on and on about the taste. Like me, he enjoyed the mac and cheese, but agreed that it didn't taste like the real thing. For dessert, I got the lemon cupcake to go. It was so sweet and lemony. My family and I will defi..."},{"business_id":"hfcJ8a-mz2pO1NU3cmeWrQ","review_id":"jDoeoInojT3lTu4m-LqDXg","date":"2020-02-24T04:25:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9145681262016296,"text_excerpt":"We just checked out Kindred and will be back. Their spicy chicken sandwich was our favorite. The buffalo cauliflower po-boy was very tasty as well! Their bread was super fresh and the yucca was perfectly cooked. My 5yo devoured the mac n cheese which also was very good. We got a few daiquiris to go for our lazy Sunday which are also yummy :)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"hfcJ8a-mz2pO1NU3cmeWrQ","photo_id":"NyynmFIT7wkYCoHXWQqt5w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/NyynmFIT7wkYCoHXWQqt5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8852954506874084},{"business_id":"hfcJ8a-mz2pO1NU3cmeWrQ","photo_id":"8zZnMa1OT49xIx9KZQWGTA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8zZnMa1OT49xIx9KZQWGTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.803754985332489},{"business_id":"hfcJ8a-mz2pO1NU3cmeWrQ","photo_id":"R5hCXfGZWjQh1vuWOQ8DLg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/R5hCXfGZWjQh1vuWOQ8DLg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.796242356300354}]},"notebook_case":null}
